            "detailed_description": "<i> The Ministry of Introductions is honored to introduce Hector, the ex-landlord succeeded by Carl Stein. You may remember him being beaten and then dragged away, but things aren't always what they seem to be... </i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616950/extras/98a8ee7e0359be2ef2075d1697ccf069.poster.avif?t=1685702324\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616950/extras/98a8ee7e0359be2ef2075d1697ccf069.webm?t=1685702324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616950/extras/98a8ee7e0359be2ef2075d1697ccf069.mp4?t=1685702324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome back to the grim dystopian future of <strong>Beholder</strong>, where ordinary people struggle to survive while subjected to the directives of an iron-fisted Government! The time has come to tell the stories of:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> the one who has fallen victim to a horrifying mistake and is now desperately seeking salvation;<br></li><li> the ones who broke the law to find happiness and are now facing the consequences;<br></li><li> the one who risked his life for the State but has been left behind;<br></li><li> the one who had everything but lost it all; <br></li><li> the one who mews!</li></ul><br>You'll meet many others, all of whom are living under the same roof – and under the thumb of a government that has absolute control over its citizens and never turns its peering eye away!<br><br>Return to Krusvice 6 and serve the State and Wise Leader well!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616950/extras/0959723aad31ae83ada139880be41be7.poster.avif?t=1685702324\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616950/extras/0959723aad31ae83ada139880be41be7.webm?t=1685702324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/616950/extras/0959723aad31ae83ada139880be41be7.mp4?t=1685702324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
